  data: {
    LLM: '1. Initial Deal: 2 down, 1 up. Betting.\n2. 4th, 5th, 6th Streets: One upcard each, with a betting round after each. If a Queen is dealt, watch the next card closely!\n3. The River: One final down-card. Final betting round.',
    Player: '1. Initial Deal: 2 down, 1 up. Betting.\n2. 4th, 5th, 6th Streets: One upcard each, with a betting round after each. If a Queen is dealt, watch the next card closely!\n3. The River: One final down-card. Final betting round.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by forming the highest-ranking 5-card Poker hand using any of the seven cards dealt, utilizing the current wild cards.',
